# Ignore heavy EDA tool outputs and workspaces
**/innovus_output/
**/workspace/
**/*.sdf
**/*.spef
**/*.pak

# Cadence/Xcelium generated files
**/xcelium.d/
**/xrun.history
**/.nfs*

# Reports
**/reports/

# Generated routed netlists
**/hardware_routed.v
**/*_routed.v

# Generated binaries
*.bin
*.elf
*.map

# Physical design files
*.gds
*.lef
*.cdl
*.dat
*.ps
